256	  - [x] `seed-a-backend.Api/Services/IBuchungenService.cs` (neue Datei):
257	    ```csharp
258	    using seed_a_backend.Api.DTOs;
259	
260	    namespace seed_a_backend.Api.Services;
261	
262	    public interface IBuchungenService
263	    {
264	        Task<BuchungErgebnis> BuchungAnlegenAsync(string veranstaltungId, BuchungAnlegenRequestDto request);
265	    }
